.TH DANBY-LAGRANGE2 1
.SH NAME
danby-lagrange2 \- larger perturbations about L4 or L5
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B temple/lagrange2
.SH MODEL
This companion experiment starts farther from the triangular equilibrium and
permits a larger velocity perturbation.  Comparison with
.I danby-lagrange1
shows the finite stability region and transition to wide or escaping motion.
.SH SOURCE
.B /appl/danby/lagrange2.b
.SH SEE ALSO
.IR orbital (2)
